	(text "Both footprints carry the same nets. Pin N = same Lightning contact on both boards:\nside A 1..8 = GND, L0p, L0n, ID0, PWR, L1n, L1p, ID1 ; side B mirrored (pin 17-k = pin k).\nJ3 = APPLE-LM-BO-V1AV (vertical plug), J4 = APPLE-LM-BO-V2A (plug overhangs board edge)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 193 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "008d5ae7-c395-443d-9c9d-1a66b78d8ffb")
	)
	(text "Port 2 = UFP (Rd). D+/D- -> HS 2:1 muxes -> Lightning L0 lane of side A or B.\nMux: SEL=0 -> FPGA (HSD1), SEL=1 -> port 2 (HSD2, 480Mb/s passthrough). OE# high (default) = disconnected.\nVBUS2 -> TPS2065C load switch (FPGA PWR_EN) -> Lightning PWR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 530 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e37f645-1c33-42cc-ac66-01557ea6c169")
	)
